(7347026, 1148481, 113016, '<td valign="top">i like this comp.</td>', 'i like this comp.', '2015-05-02 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347032, 1148343, 113016, '<td valign="top">i like idea of this one.  I don''t feel you got the results you may have wanted.  I feel these long exposure night shots require multiple exposures to drill down the shadows and the highlights, then for that to be blended together.  As I wrote on another image that I didn''t score very well, I''m always hesitant to comment critically, because you never know the circumstance of the shot.  If you''re not familiar with the process I''m mentioning above, feel free to hit me with a PM and I''ll send you a few links to some photogs who are perfecting the technique.  I think this subject is worth the effort.</td>', 'i like idea of this one.  I don''t feel you got the results you may have wanted.  I feel these long exposure night shots require multiple exposures to drill down the shadows and the highlights, then for that to be blended together.  As I wrote on another image that I didn''t score very well, I''m always hesitant to comment critically, because you never know the circumstance of the shot.  If you''re not familiar with the process I''m mentioning above, feel free to hit me with a PM and I''ll send you a few links to some photogs who are perfecting the technique.  I think this subject is worth the effort.', '2015-05-02 13:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347034, 1148459, 113016, '<td valign="top">I didn''t score this very high (4). I just didn''t feel there was enough strength in the subject to grab ahold of me and keep me looking.  As I keep looking, it seems an interesting location, so there may be more there to explore in the details.   Good luck!</td>', 'I didn''t score this very high (4). I just didn''t feel there was enough strength in the subject to grab ahold of me and keep me looking.  As I keep looking, it seems an interesting location, so there may be more there to explore in the details.   Good luck!', '2015-05-02 13:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347036, 1148297, 113016, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject and the comp on this one.  I didn''t score it very high (4) because I felt it may have been a ''button push'' on the post work.  I always hesitate to comment critically like that because I don''t know what software you''re using and MORE IMPORTANTLY...we all have different tastes.  But I wanted to explain why I gave the score I did.  It feels like an HDR image.  May be single frame with the HDR adjustment applied.  What influenced my score was that I felt it has flatten out the image too much.  Moving everything to similar brightness/contrast levels.  Good luck!</td>', 'I really like the subject and the comp on this one.  I didn''t score it very high (4) because I felt it may have been a ''button push'' on the post work.  I always hesitate to comment critically like that because I don''t know what software you''re using and MORE IMPORTANTLY...we all have different tastes.  But I wanted to explain why I gave the score I did.  It feels like an HDR image.  May be single frame with the HDR adjustment applied.  What influenced my score was that I felt it has flatten out the image too much.  Moving everything to similar brightness/contrast levels.  Good luck!', '2015-05-02 13:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347037, 1148449, 113016, '<td valign="top">as I scroll the images again, I find myself more drawn to this.  I really like the perspective!  But, I didn''t score it very high though, mainly because of the on camera flash.  For me personally, it feels just a bit too bright for the circumstance.  Confusing my brain a bit since the main light source is coming from the other direction.  Good luck!</td>', 'as I scroll the images again, I find myself more drawn to this.  I really like the perspective!  But, I didn''t score it very high though, mainly because of the on camera flash.  For me personally, it feels just a bit too bright for the circumstance.  Confusing my brain a bit since the main light source is coming from the other direction.  Good luck!', '2015-05-02 13:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347038, 1148368, 113016, '<td valign="top">this is a cute shot.  And I like the processing.  I didn''t score it very high because it didn''t grab me personally (although the no $$ part if HIGHLY relate-able..ha!).  I was looking for more monumental images.  Good Luck!</td>', 'this is a cute shot.  And I like the processing.  I didn''t score it very high because it didn''t grab me personally (although the no $$ part if HIGHLY relate-able..ha!).  I was looking for more monumental images.  Good Luck!', '2015-05-02 13:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347039, 1148210, 113016, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one.  My score was a (4) for this.  I just was looking for more to define the environment.  This looks like it''s on top of a fence column?  It''s got definate interest in my opinion.  I just am not sure about the comp.  which in fairness to you....could be this was the only angle you could grab the image.  <br/>Initially, I wasn''t sure about the flare...but I''m starting to like more an more.  The color and the pattern seems similar to the flag.  Good Luck!</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one.  My score was a (4) for this.  I just was looking for more to define the environment.  This looks like it''s on top of a fence column?  It''s got definate interest in my opinion.  I just am not sure about the comp.  which in fairness to you....could be this was the only angle you could grab the image.  Initially, I wasn''t sure about the flare...but I''m starting to like more an more.  The color and the pattern seems similar to the flag.  Good Luck!', '2015-05-02 13:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347041, 1148230, 113016, '<td valign="top">this has got wonderful color.  I LOVE the smooth feel of the horse body.  The light and camera captured it really well.  I didn''t score it high though (4), because there just wasn''t enough there to hold me personally.  Good luck!!</td>', 'this has got wonderful color.  I LOVE the smooth feel of the horse body.  The light and camera captured it really well.  I didn''t score it high though (4), because there just wasn''t enough there to hold me personally.  Good luck!!', '2015-05-02 14:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347054, 1148488, 113016, '<td valign="top">This took me some time to see it.  But this is pretty cool.  Unfortunately because I can''t see it clearly enough, I didn''t score it high (4).  I''m not sure if there''s any post work done to the image, but for me, I''d like to see the carvings more prominent.  I''m not sure how though...:o)  I think your ''access'' to the sculpture was limited.  It may be that it''s done in post with selective areas of curves, and adjusting the shadows to show the depth of the carved areas.  Regardless, I really like this subject.  Good Luck!</td>', 'This took me some time to see it.  But this is pretty cool.  Unfortunately because I can''t see it clearly enough, I didn''t score it high (4).  I''m not sure if there''s any post work done to the image, but for me, I''d like to see the carvings more prominent.  I''m not sure how though...:o)  I think your ''access'' to the sculpture was limited.  It may be that it''s done in post with selective areas of curves, and adjusting the shadows to show the depth of the carved areas.  Regardless, I really like this subject.  Good Luck!', '2015-05-02 14:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347055, 1148411, 113016, '<td valign="top">Looks peaceful.  Unfortunately, this was not an image I scored very high (4).  For me, I think there my be more choices to the composition.  I am never one to crit someone''s vision.  Because it''s your vision.  But for me personally, the trees on the left make me uncomfortable in what I feel should be a tranquil setting.  Good Luck!</td>', 'Looks peaceful.  Unfortunately, this was not an image I scored very high (4).  For me, I think there my be more choices to the composition.  I am never one to crit someone''s vision.  Because it''s your vision.  But for me personally, the trees on the left make me uncomfortable in what I feel should be a tranquil setting.  Good Luck!', '2015-05-02 14:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347056, 1148443, 113016, '<td valign="top">I looked up Bundeena and if I found the right place, looks like a beautiful area in NSW.  In looking online, it makes me want to see more of this area in the image.  Although this is very pretty in the repeating lines and the reflections, and silhouette, it just didn''t hold me well enough to score it high. (4)  Good Luck!!</td>', 'I looked up Bundeena and if I found the right place, looks like a beautiful area in NSW.  In looking online, it makes me want to see more of this area in the image.  Although this is very pretty in the repeating lines and the reflections, and silhouette, it just didn''t hold me well enough to score it high. (4)  Good Luck!!', '2015-05-02 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347057, 1148031, 113016, '<td valign="top">i like the subject on this one.  It didn''t get a great score from me (4), I feel it may be straight out of the camera.  It also feels un-level and a bit un-balanced.  <br/>I always hesitate to be critical because you never know the circumstance around the shot being taken.  Good luck!</td>', 'i like the subject on this one.  It didn''t get a great score from me (4), I feel it may be straight out of the camera.  It also feels un-level and a bit un-balanced.  I always hesitate to be critical because you never know the circumstance around the shot being taken.  Good luck!', '2015-05-02 14:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347058, 1148486, 113016, '<td valign="top">I love the conversion to BW on this.  I didn''t score it very high though (4).  For me, I think there may have been better ''moments'' than the one you selected.  There''s alot of interesting things going on in the frame...starts with the little girl, but more importantly the workers and the one in the fountain.  I''d have loved to see how that played out.  :o)  Good Luck!</td>', 'I love the conversion to BW on this.  I didn''t score it very high though (4).  For me, I think there may have been better ''moments'' than the one you selected.  There''s alot of interesting things going on in the frame...starts with the little girl, but more importantly the workers and the one in the fountain.  I''d have loved to see how that played out.  :o)  Good Luck!', '2015-05-02 14:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347059, 1148444, 113016, '<td valign="top">this is nicely shot and nicely processed to open up the shadows.  very gently done. :o)  I didn''t score it high though (4), because I was looking for more on the composition.  I think these are difficult challenges, because you''re torn between capturing the monument so people know what it is....and capturing it with your own creative twist.  For me, this frame feels like it''s the former.  Trying to show the monument, rather than putting your touch on it compositionally.  I think you put your finger print on the post side though.  Good Luck!</td>', 'this is nicely shot and nicely processed to open up the shadows.  very gently done. :o)  I didn''t score it high though (4), because I was looking for more on the composition.  I think these are difficult challenges, because you''re torn between capturing the monument so people know what it is....and capturing it with your own creative twist.  For me, this frame feels like it''s the former.  Trying to show the monument, rather than putting your touch on it compositionally.  I think you put your finger print on the post side though.  Good Luck!', '2015-05-02 14:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
