(7347603, 1147987, 113016, '<td valign="top">congrats Neat! among my top picks<br/>i love the tone and the vignette.  The framing had me thinking this was a person from the thumbnails.  Very nice.<br/> <br/>**congrats on your recent run of success!!  Awesome!  And although it''s wonderful to be ANYWHERE close to you on these past couple challenges, I have a sense you''ll stand alone in third on this challenge.  I''m seeing I got a little carried away on my ''cleaning up'' my entry.  Not sure it will hold on, and if not..rightly so.</td>', 'congrats Neat! among my top picksi love the tone and the vignette.  The framing had me thinking this was a person from the thumbnails.  Very nice. **congrats on your recent run of success!!  Awesome!  And although it''s wonderful to be ANYWHERE close to you on these past couple challenges, I have a sense you''ll stand alone in third on this challenge.  I''m seeing I got a little carried away on my ''cleaning up'' my entry.  Not sure it will hold on, and if not..rightly so.', '2015-05-04 11:34:31.000000', NULL, 0),
